# {Project} — Prototype Specification & Usability Validation

## 1. State Transition Matrix
| Trigger Event | Source Screen / State | Target Screen / State | Animation & Easing |
|---|---|---|---|
| Click `[+ New Item]` | Dashboard / Default | Drawer Modal / Open | Slide Left, $200\text{ms}$ `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` |
| Click `[Submit]` | Drawer Modal / Valid | Drawer Modal / Submitting | Spinner fade in, $100\text{ms}$ |
| Request Succeeds | Drawer / Submitting | Dashboard / Toast Notification | Fade out drawer, Toast slide up $150\text{ms}$ |

## 2. Moderated Usability Testing Protocol
* **Participant Cohort:** $N = 8$ target users matching primary persona.
* **Scenario 1:** "You need to find the latest high-priority task and assign it to a team member."
  * *Success Path:* `Dashboard -> Filter -> Detail Modal -> Assign Dropdown -> Confirm`.
  * *Direct Success Target:* $\ge 85\%$ completion without moderator hints.
* **Scenario 2:** "Attempt to submit an invalid form and recover from the error state."
  * *Success Path:* `Verify error banner renders at top with field-level inline error markers`.

## 3. Iteration Action Items
| Finding Description | Severity | Remediation Action |
|---|---|---|
| Users missed the filter dropdown on mobile | High | Increase touch target to minimum $48\text{px}$ and add search bar prominence |
